						<tr>
							<td height="50" colspan="3" valign="top" class="windowbg2" align="left">I tell you what, all those bastards who post their progress in the top 10 guilds list topic (you know, the one for tracking guild progress) deserve whatever they get! I, personally, can&#039;t believe the amount of audacity it must take to post that you killed something that&#039;s part of progression. The only thing worse than doing that is the other people who come along to give a simple gratz. Some people think that may be common courtesy, but don&#039;t believe that! Oh, no...it&#039;s actually a circle jerk in disguise! If you tell people about your successful kills in that thread, you should be dragged into the road and shot.<br /><br />Seriously, that topic is 200 pages, the majority of which is arguements. People posting what they&#039;ve killed and the subsequent &#039;grats&#039; type posts that follow are just about the only positive posts in that thing.<br /><br />I think it would be interesting to know what guild and server was awesome enough for Toastie to join though?<br /><br />(PS - I didn&#039;t send a PM asking for Toastie to be banned)</td>
