						<tr>
							<td height="50" colspan="3" valign="top" class="windowbg2" align="left">Sir, I may not agree with your opinion, but I will fight to the death.....with you in a no holds barred cage match.<br /><br />For serious though, if someone comes here expecting to have rights to post their asshat opinion, then they might also expect someone else to have the right to call them an asshat. Just like it turns out I was recently an asshat and got called on it. (sorry all! /grouphugs! lol)<br /><br />I enjoy the term &#039;asshat&#039; and don&#039;t know why.</td>
